# --- Quarto build output ---------------------------------------------------
# All of this is regenerated by `quarto render`, so it does not belong in the
# repo. Keeping it out also stops the rendered HTML from showing up as a huge
# unreadable diff every time someone re-renders.
/.quarto/
*_files/
mapa_final.html
mapa_final_static.html
pollinator_map.html
pollinators_wrangling.html
PROGRESS.html

